    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Bell is ringing and there is no escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is quickly shrouded in darkness and horrifying creatures lurk for Marv.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He must face his fears and find a way out of this nightmare or he will be trapped in hellfire forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Immerse yourself in a chilling 2D survival horror experience, where fear lurks around every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Navigate through a world engulfed in darkness, facing horrifying creatures that relentlessly pursue Marv.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Use limited resources wisely and strategize to endure the nightmarish challenges that await you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Solve puzzles and uncover the dark secrets that shroud the eerie world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147900/extras/86a5505b4fc85c6e4dd351ca29e59e72.avif?t=1735034099\" /></div></p>",
